# Map click command

- Players manage provinces, armies, and settlements by clicking them on the strategic map.
- Phaser emits picks. A pure resolver decides selection vs order intent. `sim-core` validates.
- Legal moves come from the read model, not from scene polygons.
- React inspectors and keyboard lists use the same IDs as map clicks.
- Do not add a panel-only order that the map cannot issue with the same command.
- Disable canvas context menu when right-click issues orders.
- Follow `.cursor/skills/map-click-command/SKILL.md`.
